    "body": "I've made `moveBefore()` not return the moved node in https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1307/commits/90d83391dfef67c2f0393acb2668b9c39bb01aab, to be consistent with TAG guidance. Given no strong opinion on `[Unscopable]`, maybe this can be closed now, do you agree @annevk?",
